        invents or inflates a number: views, installs and ratings are real counts that start at zero, and a page shows &quot;New&quot; until a count is real. The older featured list
        ({n(legacy.length)} on it) still shows as staff picks without a reason; manage it on <Link className="underline" href="/admin/cyrus/community#featured">Community</Link>.
